{
  "name": "101 - TOOL - set_bookkeeping_profile",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Saving what the agent knows about your books\n\nStores the facts that decide every suggestion: your usual suppliers, the\ncoding rules you already follow, and the amount above which you always\nwant to decide yourself.\n\nA blank field keeps whatever was saved before. It never means 'erase\nthat'. Nothing here is guessed: an invented account code would produce a\nwrong suggestion on every transaction from that supplier, quietly.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
